  "raw_meta_yaml": "{% set name = \"dandi\" %}\n{% set version = \"0.78.0\" %}\n\npackage:\n  name: {{ name|lower }}\n  version: {{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  url: https://pypi.org/packages/source/{{ name[0] }}/{{ name }}/{{ name }}-{{ version }}.tar.gz\n  sha256: dc6534ce24af32d4654e0d7d526fe1adc9062abd228cf95b7d9ea7defe2e1a0b\n  patches:\n    # bids-validator-deno is not yet available on conda-forge;\n    # make it a soft dependency until a feedstock is created\n    - 0001-Gracefully-handle-missing-bids-validator-deno.patch\n\nbuild:\n  number: 1\n  skip: true  # [py<311]\n  entry_points:\n    - dandi=dandi.cli.command:main\n  script: {{ PYTHON }} -m pip install . -vv\n\nrequirements:\n  build:\n    - python                              # [build_platform != target_platform]\n    - cross-python_{{ target_platform }}  # [build_platform != target_platform]\n  host:\n    - python\n    - pip\n    - setuptools >=38.3.0\n  run:\n    - python\n    - bidsschematools >=1.0,<2.0\n    # bids-validator-deno >=2.0.5 -- not yet on conda-forge; patched to be optional\n    - click >=8.2\n    - click-didyoumean >=0.3.1\n    # 0.13.0 lacks the downgrade migrations the client uses to talk to older\n    # Archive servers; 0.14.0 restored them\n    - dandischema >=0.12.0,!=0.13.0,<0.15.0\n    - etelemetry >=0.2.2\n    - fasteners >=0.19\n    - fscacher >=0.3.0\n    - hdmf >=4.1.0\n    - humanize >=4.5.0\n    - interleave >=0.3,<1.0\n    - joblib >=1.3.0\n    - keyring >=23.10.0\n    - keyrings.alt >=5.0.0\n    - numcodecs >=0.11.0\n    - nwbinspector >=0.7.0\n    - packaging >=22.0\n    - platformdirs >=4.1.0\n    - pycryptodomex >=3.16.0\n    - pydantic >=2.9,<3.0\n    - pynwb >=3.1.0\n    - pyout >=0.7.3\n    - python-dateutil >=2.9.0\n    - requests >=2.30,<3.0\n    - ruamel.yaml >=0.16.0,<1\n    - semantic_version >=2.10.0\n    - tenacity >=8.2.0\n    # 0.1.62 is the first release built for numpy 2.x\n    - tensorstore >=0.1.62  # [not win]\n    - urllib3 >=2.0.2\n    - yarl >=1.9.1,<2.0\n    - zarr >=2.18.0,<=3.1.5\n    - zarr-checksum >=0.4.0,<0.5\n\ntest:\n  requires:\n    - anys >=0.3,<1.0\n    - bash >=4.5  # [not win]\n    - git\n    - opencv\n    - libopencv * *headless*  # [linux]\n    - pytest\n    - pytest-mock\n    - pytest-rerunfailures\n    - pytest-timeout\n    - responses !=0.24.0,!=0.25.5\n    - vcrpy >=5.0.0\n  imports:\n    - dandi\n  commands:\n    - dandi --help\n\nabout:\n  home: https://github.com/dandi/dandi-cli\n  license: Apache-2.0\n  license_family: Apache\n  license_file: LICENSE\n  summary: Command line client for interaction with DANDI Archive elements\n  dev_url: https://github.com/dandi/dandi-cli\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - yarikoptic\n",
